I'm trying to simulate having a cusotm protocol via simple boilerplate code which is inside the_best_protocol_ever.c

To make this work, i need hooks to fio so i pulled the directory and compiled it. After pulling fio, we need to compile it withe following flags:

gcc -shared -fPIC -rdynamic -o the_best_protocol_ever.so \
    the_best_protocol_ever.c -I./fio \
    -undefined dynamic_lookup

